1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:07,730
Your AI agent can write you a great training plan. Then you walk into the gym, and it is stuck in a chat window.

2
00:00:07,730 --> 00:00:17,110
FitLoop puts your agent's plan on your phone, your watch and your Even G2 glasses, and sends back how it went.

3
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:26,220
In FitLoop's settings, copy the MCP address, and add it to your agent. Claude Code is shown here; any MCP client works.

4
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:29,420
Sign in from your agent, once.

5
00:00:29,970 --> 00:00:36,470
FitLoop shows exactly what it may do. Allow it, and you are connected.

6
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:41,750
Then just ask: set up my training plan, starting today.

7
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:51,880
It reads FitLoop's plan guide and your profile, builds the week, and checks it against FitLoop's rules before it publishes.

8
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:59,540
Seconds later, today's workout and meals are on your phone, with a note on what it planned.

9
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:03,780
At the gym, tap the workout to start it.

10
00:01:03,780 --> 00:01:09,480
Each exercise shows the set, the target, and your agent's form cues.

11
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:15,960
Finish a set and tap Set done. The rest timer starts by itself.

12
00:01:17,060 --> 00:01:23,220
To go hands-free, get a pairing code in Settings, and type it into the Even app, once.

13
00:01:23,220 --> 00:01:28,920
Now your day is on your Even G2. Tap the R1 ring to open the workout.

14
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:35,320
Tap again when a set is done. The rest timer runs right in front of you, next to your heart rate.

15
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:41,520
Something hurts? Hold the ring, and tell your agent, without stopping.

16
00:01:42,770 --> 00:01:46,150
Check off your meals as you eat them.

17
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:53,550
Later, ask your agent to take a look. It reads your note over MCP, and plays it safe.

18
00:01:53,550 --> 00:01:56,870
It answers you right in FitLoop,

19
00:01:58,030 --> 00:02:05,490
and publishes a new plan. Today's Romanian deadlift is now a glute bridge.

20
00:02:06,660 --> 00:02:12,920
Your agent writes the plan. FitLoop keeps you on it, and tells your agent how it went.

21
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:17,280
FitLoop. Your agent's plan, wherever you train.
